flowchart LR
    U[Reviewer] --> FE[Next.js Frontend / Vercel]
    FE --> API[FastAPI Backend / Vercel]
    API --> VAL[Input Validation]
    VAL --> RTR[Document Router]
    RTR -->|Plain text| CAN[Canonical Document]
    RTR -->|Digital PDF| PM[PyMuPDF]
    PM --> CAN
    RTR -->|Image or visual PDF| GEMV[Gemini Visual Transcription]
    GEMV --> CAN
    CAN --> EXT[Gemini Clinical Extraction]
    EXT --> DVAL[Deterministic Validation]
    DVAL --> REV[Gemini Review Synthesis]
    REV --> QG[Final Quality Gate]
    QG --> DB[(Neon PostgreSQL)]
    DB --> API
